        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1795135?u=8b4759f2d0964426ac6f2aeacf061ad1ee0e24db&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">According to Apple's bug tracking system, this is when the content attributes landed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The JS properties were added afterwards in Safari 18 (which MDN correctly reflects).</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>shadowrootdelegatesfocus content attribute was added with the initial implementation of declarative shadow DOM in 16.4: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/46837e56d6f57f7e52bf92c9534cc7683909eee5/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/46837e56d6f57f7e52bf92c9534cc7683909eee5\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>46837e5</tt></a></li>\n<li>shadowrootclonable content attribute: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/79d2dec92caef6f7df33125ab34bd70e36c982c2/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/79d2dec92caef6f7df33125ab34bd70e36c982c2\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>79d2dec</tt></a></li>\n<li>shadowrootserializable content attribute &amp; JS property: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/de64e62a2a5041b0d59b985feba7e080993c36b8/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/de64e62a2a5041b0d59b985feba7e080993c36b8\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>de64e62</tt></a></li>\n<li>shadowrootdelegatesfocus &amp; shadowrootclonable JS properties: <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/db0669a6fa034ab98e120208f72fd232948b1fcc/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/commit/db0669a6fa034ab98e120208f72fd232948b1fcc\">WebKit/WebKit@<tt>db0669a</tt></a></li>\n</ul>",
