        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds data for the clear, get, and set methods of webextensions.api.types.BrowserSetting. This enables compatibility data to be correctly displayed on MDN.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #26521.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2998241653\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26521\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26521/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/26521\">#26521</a><br>\nRelated MDN content change in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3376751579\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40989\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40989/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40989\">mdn/content#40989</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27737",
            "title": "Add member data to webextensions.api.types.BrowserSetting for Issue 26521",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-02T17:59:11.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-02T16:21:42.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "rebloor",
                "url": "https://github.com/rebloor"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Spec: <a href=\"https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#dom-identitycredentialerror-error\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c-fedid.github.io/FedCM/#dom-identitycredentialerror-error</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome implements this under the wrong property name <code class=\"notranslate\">code</code>, see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3375883038\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/780\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/780/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c-fedid/FedCM/issues/780\">w3c-fedid/FedCM#780</a> and <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/427474985\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/427474985</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Docs: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3376224258\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40986\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40986/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40986\">mdn/content#40986</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27736",
            "title": "Add IdentityCredentialError.error",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-02T14:28:45.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-02T14:28:07.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">This was added in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2053988774\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/21721\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/21721/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/21721\">#21721</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The Error API, which mainly manifests as useful properties of the return error object when a FedCM get() call rejects.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">What the FedCM Error API really is, though, is <code class=\"notranslate\">IdentityCredentialError</code> and we already have compat data for that.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Remove this entry is it only appears without further explanation on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CredentialsContainer/get#browser_compatibility\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CredentialsContainer/get#browser_compatibility</a>. It's not even in web-features yet, either.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm creating MDN docs for <code class=\"notranslate\">IdentityCredentialError</code> in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3376224258\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40986\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40986/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40986\">mdn/content#40986</a>.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27735",
            "title": "Remove 'Error API' feature from CredentialsContainer.get",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-02T14:19:37.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-02T14:18:53.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Elchi3",
                "url": "https://github.com/Elchi3"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/349114?u=1185d4fc45f5ff4c4a592b30a4dd2bb5cd1b7128&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-credential-management/#federated\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-credential-management/#federated</a>, the FederatedCredential interface has no members \"iconURL\" or \"name\": The constructor has these as parameters but their support seems to be identical to the constructor (and other constructor parameters also exist), so I think we should remove this here as not needed.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27733",
            "title": "Remove iconURL and name from FederatedCredential",
